# Fonts licensed for this machine only.
#
# thmanyah, Boutros and the rest permit use on your own devices and forbid
# putting the file anywhere a third party can fetch it. This repository is
# pushed to GitHub, so a font committed here is a font published — which is
# the exact thing those licences prohibit. They stay out of git, and the
# route that serves them refuses to exist in a production build.
/fonts-local/
